{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207451-onyx-dice","id":1207451,"title":"Onyx Dice","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-15T16:56:41-07:00","id":1207451,"title":"Onyx Dice","content":"Well, I couldn't find another thread about the Onyx Dice App (strangely), and I couldn't really find a decent topic to place it in, so I thought I would put it here, since I only ever really read the Exalted forum, and since I only use the App to play Exalted. If this belongs somewhere else, though, please move it.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know what the &quot;Sync&quot; button in Settings is supposed to do?<br /> <br /> Also, in regards to their current trouble with Apple and the iOS version not showing purchases, I have noted some weird behavior. The last set of dice I tried to buy after the bug was the Lunars set, but of course it never shows up as purchased - even though it will produce a popup saying that I already own that content if I try to buy it again. But then I installed the app on my two oldest daughters' iPads. One of them got access to all my purchased dice (including the Lunars set), and the other one did not have access to any of the purchased dice. Both are signed into my iTunes and AppStore account for purchases. To try to get the Lunars set to show up on my own iPad - since it showed up on one of my daughters' - I then deleted and reinstalled the app on my iPad, but now it shows that no dice sets have been purchased... Anyone else have any of these experiences?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T18:30:36-07:00","id":1207470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207451-onyx-dice#post1207451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone know what the &quot;Sync&quot; button in Settings is supposed to do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it is <i>should </i>syncronise local data with cloud storage to ensure you have the latest version of the app. However, all that <i>seems </i>to happen for me is that it just resets everything to default settings.<br /> <br /> \u200b(I have no issues with purchased dice not showing, but have only installed the app on one device, using Bluestacks emulation.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 04-16-2018, 01:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T19:18:22-07:00","id":1207482,"title":"","content":"Are you using Android or iOS?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-15T21:14:33-07:00","id":1207527,"title":"","content":"It syncs your current app with your purchases. For example, I purchased the Exalted board and the base Exalted dice. My phone took a tumble and I had to replace it with insurance. I download the app on my new phone, but the purchases aren't there. I hit Sync and it checks for purchases connected to your google/apple account and reinstates them.<br /> <br /> It's a pretty common function in apps with in-app purchases.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T02:54:32-07:00","id":1207593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207451-onyx-dice?p=1207527#post1207527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It syncs your current app with your purchases.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s what I kind of figured (although most apps use the phrase \u2018restore purchases\u2019), but since it seemed to do nothing (because of the bug, I suppose), it made me wonder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T18:04:10-07:00","id":1208646,"title":"","content":"Hi! I'm the Onyx Dice developer.<br /> <br /> I'm really sorry you ran into this. The bug is an issue with Apple accounts. Once your account is busted, any purchase you attempt both succeeds and fails. Apple takes your money, and records that the purchase happened, but then tells the app the purchase failed for unknown reasons. Sync normally does the right thing of deleting all the local data and getting the right values from the server, but for people with broken accounts, Apple reports that you have purchased nothing. It's super frustrating and I've been working with Apple to get the issue fixed for 2 months, but they've shown no motivation to correct it.<br /> <br /> We have a build that we are just waiting for permission to release that will allow us give the missing items to the people like yourself while we wait for Apple. I'm hoping that we get that go ahead on Friday, but it's difficult to predict these things. When the build does happen, I'll be sure to PM your account so I can fix the issue with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11315-remulader","name":"Remulader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11315_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T02:52:30-07:00","id":1208783,"title":"","content":"Awesome! Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T05:04:13-07:00","id":1208803,"title":"","content":"I'm loving Onyx Dice by and large. The only issue I've had is that turning off double-10s means that 10s aren't counted at all.<br /> <br /> I have a friend who reaaaally wants it to be available on the Windows Store so he can use it on his desktop that he runs his game from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T09:55:43-07:00","id":1208927,"title":"","content":"The 10's issue is fixed in the next version.<br /> <br /> Windows Store will likely never happen, sorry. If your friend is motivated, he can always do an android emulator: <a href=\"https://www.andyroid.net/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.andyroid.net/</a> We have several people that use that one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11315-remulader","name":"Remulader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11315_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T16:13:52-07:00","id":1209043,"title":"","content":"Remulader, what about the black space at the top of the iPhone 8 (completely unused). Are there plans to extend the screen?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T18:44:01-07:00","id":1209084,"title":"","content":"I've not heard of that. I'll get my hands on an 8 and figure out the issue, but it probably won't happen in this upcoming release unless we have to go through Apple cert again for whatever reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11315-remulader","name":"Remulader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11315_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T19:19:02-07:00","id":1209095,"title":"","content":"As long